Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:27.49,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(200,266.667)\bord0\shad0\1c&HAD4B00&\fad(250,250)\blur3.333\p1}m 0 0 l 60 0 l 60 200 l 0 200{\p0}
